sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User
    participant Web
    participant API@{ "type": "control" }
    participant DB@{ "type": "database" }
    User->>Web: Open the dashboard
    Web->>+API: GET /stats
    API->>DB: Query the last 30 days
    DB-->>API: Rows
    alt cache hit
        API-->>Web: Cached stats
    else cache miss
        API->>API: Aggregate
        API-->>-Web: Fresh stats
    end
    Note over Web,API: Responses are gzip-compressed
    Web-->>User: Render charts
